{"sections":[{"slug":"Riemann--Roch定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Riemann--Roch定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Riemann–Roch 定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复分析中</span>, Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理描述了给定零点与可能极点的亚纯函数空间的维数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它将紧</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的复分析与其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拓扑亏格","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">联系起来</span>.</p>\n<p>Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理将代数或解析簇</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上局部自由层</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Euler示性数","text":"Euler <span lang=\"zh\">示性数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表示为</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/示性类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">示性类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理与</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Mittag-Leffler问题","text":"Mittag-Leffler <span lang=\"zh\">问题</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有关</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/亏格","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的紧</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲线","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":" $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的全纯向量丛</span> $E$,\n$$\r\n\\chi(C,E) = \\deg(E) + \\operatorname{rk}(E)(1-g).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正则","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正则性</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影曲线</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/除子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">除子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $D=\\sum a_{p}\\cdot (p)$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\deg D=\\sum a_p \\deg p$,\n$$\r\n\\chi(C,\\mathcal O_C(D))=\\deg D + \\chi(C,\\mathcal O_C).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/亏格","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的紧</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":" $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/除子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">除子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $D$, $H^\\bullet(M,\\mathcal{O}_D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">均为有限维</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span>\n$$\r\n\\chi(H^\\bullet(M,\\mathcal{O}_D)) -\\deg D= 1-g.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">推广</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Hirzebruch--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Hirzebruch–Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}